 at all. And no, not because R's are bad so we were blown out, but rather OF COURSE there is obvious fraud.\nWhat IS shocking to me is that despite the R's, Iran, the economy, etc., that people still showed up and turned out.\nThe Dems didn't win jack shit. They just cheated, had help from other countries, all the fraud(s).\nIt's what they do.\nThe only thing I'm waiting for is a response. Trump has had years to plan and put systems in place.\nIt's popcorn time, let's see what happens now folks...</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 17, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToYzo9Gi", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 16, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8925050, "raw_content": "", "author": "Iranhasnukes", "created": 1793901385127, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "CyanScales", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToYzo9Gi.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/kOPm0sd9WGLk.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/CcjwOXw0Zinm4lFp.jpeg", "width": 607, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "UARp8-4n~q%M9FM{%Mt7t7oLofRj-;ofWBju", "full_resolution": [1424, 1125]}, "title": "Sundance: The tell is desantis looks better today than before the election. Big tech wants their stooge and needed to take out maga to do it.\r\nDesantis is such a scam. Florida being ok while the rest of the country burns is the tell.\r\n